{"about_the_game":"<strong>CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD</strong><br><br><br>This airport has been in a terrible state for a long time, and now it\u2019s up to you to make it great again! Fight the forces of nature that have taken over this place. Use modern tools,  destroy, trim, clean, and renovate.<br><br><strong>It\u2019s all in your hands</strong><br><br>Use multiple tools to destroy, trim, clean up and wash elements of the airport area. Only a few things in life are as satisfying as power cleaning a dirty airplane! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.poster.avif?t=1713180075\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.webm?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/953b4f5c6f1632701227f8e6bb715637.mp4?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Flying cargo</strong><br><br>Collect supplies that will be delivered to you via parachute drops! Use the items wisely and plan out where you want them to be placed. You never know what you\u2019re going to get in the next loot crate!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.poster.avif?t=1713180075\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.webm?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/4dbfbb3e139f76b36eafd2d5abdc629b.mp4?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Plan and decide</strong><br><br>Start with a small airport and end up with a massive, international one! Manage, equip, expand, and remember that this place will be visited by thousands of people every day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.poster.avif?t=1713180075\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.webm?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/9aa99823fe99636c76fd9d746857ef1c.mp4?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Battle the forces of nature</strong><br><br>This place has not seen a human for years and has become a jungle. Can you overcome the overgrown vegetation in constantly changing weather conditions?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/0f555d2fbf168c7d9880fe4aa2dc8626.poster.avif?t=1713180075\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/0f555d2fbf168c7d9880fe4aa2dc8626.webm?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/extras/0f555d2fbf168c7d9880fe4aa2dc8626.mp4?t=1713180075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1356250?t=1713180075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1713180075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c